                                "sense_id": "3856f4ef-58bc-33db-a8ce-fa029024ff4c",
                                "text": "They just don't realise that the t-shirt line they designed, the festival they had on the grounds of their family castle and those alcoholic lollies they are desperately trying to fire up wouldn't exist if it wasn't for that dench inheritance fund."
